              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany kïlït Petro kö, nyini tomönye kïngalan, kïnya Yeso kïlö, “Simon, inonenyi lö ne nya nyo le nyi? Kwöghchini ngo surï pöytoghi ngwïny? Piko koronini nya, anta to?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.25"
            ]
