          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo merokonye kelelchinöcha pïchï. Kïlenyona wïyö tanga nanam aiwirchï pörköyö ori ainömï koghoghwö nyo nömöy pörköyononi nyo pö tagh aingany kut atenyorchinö ropïyon ateghaktena surucha kwodeny.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
